SHADOW MODULE SUITE - ALL IN ONE
==============================================================================
Version      : v1.0.0
Modules      : 146
Target       : Poco M2 Pro (beryllium)
Chipset      : Snapdragon 660 (SDM660) - Adreno 512 GPU - 4 GB / 6 GB RAM
Root         : KernelSU (also works with Magisk)
ROMs         : Custom ROMs (LineageOS, crDroid, Pixel Experience, AOSP,
                MIUI based, Evolution X, Infinity X ...)
Built        : 2026-10-18

WHAT THIS ZIP DOES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
One flashable ZIP that installs 146 tuned modules on your rooted
Poco M2 Pro. Every module is named SHADOW_<Module> and lives in its own
folder inside /data/adb/modules, so you can switch any single one of them
on or off from the KernelSU app at any time.

Nothing in this pack is guessed blindly: every module walks the real sysfs
and proc nodes of the running kernel and writes only to the nodes that
actually exist. When your custom ROM does not expose a knob, the module
logs "skip" and moves on. Nothing breaks, nothing reboots by itself.

THE THREE THINGS YOU ASKED FOR
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. GAMING
   Shadow_GamingBoost, Shadow_GamingGPUBoost, Shadow_GamingStutterFix,
   Shadow_GamingCPUMinFreq, Shadow_GamingFPSUnlock and the rest of the
   Gaming group pin the CPU, unlock the Adreno 512, remove the frame
   drops and lower the network latency.

2. TOUCH ENHANCER
   Shadow_TouchEnhancer raises the panel sampling rate, sharpens the touch
   response, enables palm rejection, kills ghost touches and protects the
   screen edges while you hold the phone in landscape.

3. FAST CHARGING + ULTRA BATTERY BACKUP
   Shadow_FastCharge raises the charge current ceiling and the voltage
   limit, Shadow_ChargeCurrentMax / Shadow_ChargeVoltageMax do it on
   their own and Shadow_ChargeSmartCharge tapers the last 30 percent so
   the battery is not stressed.
   Shadow_UltraBatteryBackup is the battery backup: it takes every one of
   your apps out of Doze, out of the app standby bucket and out of the
   background restriction, then repeats the whole list every 10 minutes,
   so nothing of yours is ever killed or restarted. It is always active,
   in every profile.

PROFILES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The whole suite follows one profile. Switch it any time with:

    sh /data/adb/shadow/control.sh profile gaming
    sh /data/adb/shadow/control.sh profile performance
    sh /data/adb/shadow/control.sh profile balanced
    sh /data/adb/shadow/control.sh profile battery

    gaming      130 modules enabled
    performance 130 modules enabled
    balanced    116 modules enabled
    battery      98 modules enabled

    8 modules are always on (the battery backup, the doze killer, the
    background release and the control centre), independent of the profile.

