INSTALL
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    1. Copy SHADOW_AllInOne_v1.0.0.zip to the phone.
    2. KernelSU app -> Modules -> Install from storage -> pick the zip.
       (Magisk app -> Modules -> Install from storage -> pick the zip)
    3. Reboot.
    4. Open the KernelSU app, the Modules tab, and you will see every
       SHADOW module listed on its own. Tap the action button of
       SHADOW_ControlCenter for the dashboard.

No metamodule is required. The pack uses scripts and properties only, so
it works on a plain KernelSU install with overlayfs support or without it.

The zip also contains 146 individual module zips in shadow_individual/ if
you would rather flash one module at a time.

IF SOMETHING GOES WRONG
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    * Every module is a normal KernelSU module: disable it in the app and
      reboot, or remove it completely, no system wipe needed.
    * Shadow_BootLoopGuard watches the boot counter. If the phone fails
      to boot three times in a row it disables the risky modules by
      itself and lets the phone come back.
    * A full reset of the suite: remove SHADOW_AllInOne and every other
      SHADOW module from the KernelSU app, then reboot.

